@baseUrl = http://localhost:5101
@token = paste-jwt-token-here

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Swagger JSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json

### List tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create task
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Review RabbitMQ event flow", "description": "Created task should appear in Users audit" }

### Update task (replace id)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Review RabbitMQ event flow", "description": "Done", "isCompleted": true }

### Delete task (replace id)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
